          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "ivcrush"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "-- to_char, never a raw `date` column: Grafana's Postgres datasource returns a\n-- date as UTC midnight and the dashboard renders in `timezone: browser`, so in\n-- ET every raw date displayed as the PREVIOUS day at 20:00 (journal freshness\n-- read \"2026-09-10 20:00:00\" for a real max of 2026-09-11). Text has no\n-- timezone to reinterpret. Same reasoning as ops_last_run_per_job's to_char.\nSELECT to_char(date, 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS date, job_name, status\nFROM job_status\nORDER BY date DESC, job_name\nLIMIT 90;",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
